ild/VM processes) before a two-worker offline Linux build in isolated source. Linux x86_64 static-runtime index admission plus all thirteen filesystem/buffer recovery tests passed; isolated source removed and services/VMs left unchanged. The initial source archive omitted preview/app-metadata.mjs; that packaging error was corrected before the successful rerun.\n\nWASM editor and release native session rebuilt. Existing browser URLs, workspace state, credentials and warm compiler/LSP caches are preserved when refreshing the local services. No Cloudflare account resources or deployment were needed.\n\nStable identity/move/discard follow-up: 9d6a14bfc40bc5c2eb5a105609e1c2a1c37f3766d131dae8f4da586edd8b7b3c. Keep the session and Cloud Sync authority parents open and automaticRestore:false.","files":null}]}